,"className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["不花钱。签租约、交押金和装修之前，花几个小时问清三件事。一是房产证上的用途，是住宅还是商业。二是这栋楼是纯住宅、商住楼，还是独立的商铺，楼上有没有人住。三是开餐饮的，看有没有专用烟道，再去当地市场监管部门问能不能办下食品经营许可。难的是房东、中介说「没问题，上一家就开过」时，还要自己去核。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["民法典第二百七十九条：「业主将住宅改变为经营性用房的，除遵守法律、法规以及管理规约外，应当经有利害关系的业主一致同意。」最高人民法院的司法解释说得更细。同一栋楼里的其他业主，都算「有利害关系的业主」。同一小区别的楼的业主，要证明自己的房子价值或者生活质量受到影响，才算。没经他们一致同意就改了的，他们请求停下来、恢复原状或者赔偿损失，法院应当支持。拿「多数业主同意了」来辩解，法院不支持。生态环境法典 2026 年 8 月 15 日起施行，大气污染防治法同时废止。法典第二百五十条禁止在三类地方新建、改建、扩建产生油烟、异味、废气的餐饮服务项目。一是居民住宅楼。二是没配专用烟道的商住综合楼。三是商住综合楼里和住户楼层相邻的商业楼层。违反的，先责令改正。拒不改正的，责令关闭，并罚 1 万元到 10 万元。法典还要求地方政府在登记注册环节，提示餐饮选址的禁止性要求。申请食品经营许可，场所要和经营的食品品种、数量相适应，还要和有毒有害场所、其他污染源保持规定的距离。反过来，房子本身不符合法律、行政法规对使用条件的强制性规定，你可以解除租赁合同。前提是没法用不是你造成的（全国）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大 (2020). 民法典（第二百七十九、七百二十四条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202006/t20200602_463888.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202006/t20200602_463888.shtml"]},"；最高人民法院 (2020 修正). 关于审理建筑物区分所有权纠纷案件适用法律若干问题的解释（第十、十一条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff808181799df6140179b092ef2d2af9","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff808181799df6140179b092ef2d2af9"]},"（国家法律法规数据库）；全国人大 (2026). 生态环境法典（第二百五十、一千一百三十二、一千二百四十二条，2026 年 8 月 15 日起施行）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=96630961659b4d87a65b7b1c595097fa","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=96630961659b4d87a65b7b1c595097fa"]},"（国家法律法规数据库）；市场监管总局 (2023). 食品经营许可和备案管理办法（市场监管总局令第 78 号，第十二条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2023/issue_10606/202307/content_6894763.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2023/issue_10606/202307/content_6894763.html"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["「上一家开过」不说明能开，可能是一直没人告，或者是法典施行前就开着的。管理规约也可能另有限制，签约前向物业要一份看。房子不让这么用、要解除租约拿回押金和装修损失的，房东不肯就得打官司。一审普通程序 6 个月起，律师费自己出，所以把「办不下证、被责令关闭可以解约退押金」写进租约更省事。要办哪些许可证，见第 7 条（要许可证的行当）和第 8 条（做食品先看自己落在哪一档）。受益人主要是你自己。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/12-26"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"找人凑钱做生意，只找亲友和员工当面谈，不在朋友圈、群里公开招人投钱，也别让亲友替你再去拉人"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/12-28"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"几个人合伙开店，开张前把出资、分钱、谁说了算、谁拿工资、怎么退出写成书面协议"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/12-03"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["开张前选对主体：个体户和合伙人赔到底，有限公司才「有限」"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["个体户和普通合伙人欠多少还多少，有限公司的股东只赔自己注册时答应出的那个数。但答应了多少，5 年内就要真拿出多少：填 100 万，就是可能欠着 100 万。公司…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/12-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不当挂名股东，不替人代持股权"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["名字登记在册，你在法律上就是股东。注册时答应出的钱要按期交齐，交不上除了补交还要赔公司的损失。公司开办时别的股东没真把钱交进来，缺多少你也跟着还多少。生意是别人…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/12-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["加盟前先查商务部备案，拿到书面披露，把「冷静期」写进合同"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["按规定，品牌方自己得先开 2 个直营店、经营满 1 年，签约后 15 日内还要去商务部门备案。签约前，它必须把加盟费、保证金怎么退、现有门店赚不赚钱等 12 项…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/12-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["注册前把名称、经营场所、经营范围和注册资本定下来，材料齐了当场就能领执照"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["登记本身不花钱，注册费 2015 年起就停征了，有人收钱，收的也不是登记费。要交的材料只有五项：申请书、身份或资格证明、经营场所文件、章程或合伙协议，加上法规另…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/12-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["要许可证的行当，证没下来不开张"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["没证就开张，由管这张证的部门按它的法规查处。连营业执照都没有、又没有专门罚则的，勒令停业、没收挣到的钱，再罚 1 万元以下。卖专营专卖的东西，或者做证券、期货、…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/12-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["做食品先看自己落在哪一档：生产和做餐饮要许可，只卖预包装的改备案，卖生鲜肉菜不用证"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["自己做东西去卖，像小吃店、卤味、烘焙、自制酱菜，都要办许可，小作坊和摊贩按本省的规矩办。只卖别人做好的整包装食品不用许可，到县级以上市场监管部门备案就行。卖生鲜…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/12"},"children":["阅读整个主题：创业与做生意：别把家底赔进去 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-star","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.